# Only a Glimmer that is a creature stops Fear of the Dark. Enduring Vitality (3/3) is killed by Bot1's Lightning Bolt on turn 3 and
# returns as an enchantment, no longer a creature, so Bot2 controls a Glimmer but no Glimmer creature: the Fear attacks, the intervening
# "if" holds (CR 603.4) and it gains menace and deathtouch for the turn. Bot2 takes 5 (20 -> 15).

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Fear of the Dark
Lightning Bolt
Swamp x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Enduring Vitality
Forest x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Fear of the Dark.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot2.Hand.Enduring Vitality.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Enduring Vitality)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot2.Battlefield.Enduring Vitality.Types = Enchantment
Bot1.Attack(Fear of the Dark > Bot2)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Fear of the Dark.Keywords = Deathtouch; Menace
? Bot2.Life = 15

[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield.Enduring Vitality.Types = Enchantment
Bot1.Battlefield.Fear of the Dark.Keywords = Deathtouch; Menace
Bot2.Life = 15
